  print 6 $wavelength 0.0 0.25 [OPD f6 w$wavelength 0.0 0.25] [PATH s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.25] [OPL s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.25] [PATH s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.25] [OPL s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.25]
  print 6 $wavelength 0.0 0.5 [OPD f6 w$wavelength 0.0 0.5] [PATH s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.5] [OPL s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.5] [PATH s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.5] [OPL s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.5]
  print 6 $wavelength 0.0 0.75 [OPD f6 w$wavelength 0.0 0.75] [PATH s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.75] [OPL s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.75] [PATH s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.75] [OPL s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 0.75]
  print 6 $wavelength 0.0 1.0 [OPD f6 w$wavelength 0.0 1.0] [PATH s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 1.0] [OPL s1..15 w$wavelength f6 0.0 1.0] [PATH s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 1.0] [OPL s1..16 w$wavelength f6 0.0 1.0]
  print 6 $wavelength -0.75 0.0 [OPD f6 w$wavelength -0.75 0.0] [PATH s1..15 w$wavelength f6 -0.75 0.0] [OPL s1..15 w$wavelength f6 -0.75 0.0] [PATH s1..16 w$wavelength f6 -0.75 0.0] [OPL s1..16 w$wavelength f6 -0.75 0.0]
